  "description": [
    "A pyridopyrimidine that is 5-oxo-5,8-dihydropyrido[2,3-<em>d</em>]pyrimidine-6-carboxylic acid substituted at position 2 by a piperazin-1-yl group and at position 8 by an ethyl group. A synthetic broad-spectrum antibacterial, it is used for treatment of gastrointestinal, biliary, and urinary infections."
